{"id":1050304,"chapter_id":1050304,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"从天上坠落下去的人，瞬间被那些怪物淹没。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"迅速暴涨的M值让这些贪婪而残暴的家伙直接变成了死役，赤裸裸地展现着自己的渴望。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"观星者","content":"愚昧不堪……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"观星者","content":"面对真实，面对虚假，和你所谓的责任。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你竟主动选择了死亡。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"观星者跳下废墟，冷眼看着那些被吸引过来的死役，在围攻猎物时，爆发出一阵阵嚎叫。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"观星者","content":"预言游戏总是会暴露人不堪的欲望和所害怕的真实。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"观星者","content":"我早就应该习惯了的。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"观星者","content":"只可惜，你终究没有资格成为我的……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"观星者转身而去，她的脸上满是失望的神情，一如看到了被咬过的苹果。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"她扬了扬手，使用自己的异能继续加剧着这些怪物的欲望暴露，以此作为给自己的小怪物最后的葬礼。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"可就在她迈出几步远的时候，她听到了身后的怪物堆中，传来了枪声。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"观星者","content":"什么……？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"观星者一愣，转头看去，那厚重的包围圈，竟然被一把手枪击穿了一个突破口。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304015,"trial_step":15,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":16}]},{"step":16,"content":"那个小小的，黑洞一样的缺口中，一股力量扑面而来，狠狠地缠绕住了观星者。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"speaker":"观星者","content":"这个是……枷锁……！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"观星者感受到自己异能被迫停滞，那些荆棘一般的力量刺入她的手腕、脖颈。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"content":"而这股力量的持有者，站在一堆怪物的中央。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"content":"他浑身是伤，漆黑的液体流入他的眼睛里，让他只能堪堪睁开。可他却毫不退缩地站在那里对着观星者说道——","female_content":"她浑身是伤，漆黑的液体流入她的眼睛里，让她只能堪堪睁开。可她却毫不退缩地站在那里对着观星者说道——","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"options":["保护我，不能让我死掉"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304022,"trial_step":22,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"保护我，不能让我死掉","goto":23}]},{"step":22,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你竟然使用枷锁……？你就不怕……！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"content":"禁闭者无法反抗枷锁下达的命令，观星者还在僵持的手轻轻抬起，开始攻击围绕在你身边的死役。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"content":"我当然不怕……","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"content":"你看向不远处的内海，漆黑一片的空洞中，传来无形的尖啸，叫嚣着你应该走向那里。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"content":"什么时候让什么人，以什么方式插手我的命运，包括我最后将葬身何处，都该由我自己决定——至少我现在绝不应该去那儿，我的枷锁和我的禁闭者……是我最强的武器。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"speaker":"观星者","content":"哈哈哈……既然如此，那我只有……遵守命令了。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"content":"你端起手枪，与观星者一起解决着这些暴动的怪物。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"尽管没有了观星者的异能催化，可它们原本就是亡命之徒，成为了死役后只会更加的暴戾。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"观星者","content":"这样的人，在这个世界里几乎遍地都是。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"speaker":"观星者","content":"没有人能保证，在暴露了自己内心深处的欲望后，不会变成这样的怪物。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你所谓的守护，也是在保全它们。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"speaker":"观星者","content":"如果没有枷锁，没有禁闭者，你将会死在它们的啃咬下。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"speaker":"观星者","content":"就算如此，你也要坚持吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"options":["我不会"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304036,"trial_step":36,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我不会","goto":37}]},{"step":36,"content":"听到你的回答，观星者的神情微微一变。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"观星者","content":"怎么？在地狱门口走了一圈后，终于明白了么？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"你转过身，握着枪对准观星者，看着她的眼睛，扣动了扳机。子弹掠过观星者的兜帽，直直射入了她身后一个偷袭的死役脑门中央。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"content":"我不会保全他们。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"content":"观星者发动异能，将被你击穿手脚却依旧不死心想要往你们这里爬的怪物统统压制。并示意你继续说下去。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"你举起枪，走到被压制的死役身前，闭上了双眼，对着他的要害开枪。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"content":"最后一个死役也被消灭，危机解除，混沌的破碎防线终于安稳下来，你看着又回归寂静的内海，对观星者说道。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"content":"我说过，我自知这条路上充满危险，也早知尽头是一切的终结。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"content":"危机遍布这个世界，但我已经身处这个框架之中。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"content":"观星者的水晶球开始转动，可里面旋转的，已然不是那些深渊一般的黑雾。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"像是砂海中的砂砾，纯白色的颗粒一点点聚集，散发着淡淡的光芒。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你在想些什么？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"speaker":"观星者","content":"既然你明明可以不接受任何对你的任命，为何要执着这个世界？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你是能触及到真实的人，这个世界上，除了你，我几乎没有找到任何同伴。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"观星者","content":"所以，哪怕你觉醒于一片朦胧混沌，哪怕你的身躯也不过是个虚假的躯壳，我也希望与你一同前往。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"content":"你们解决掉了所有的死役，观星者看着你，看着你把她压制住的死役一个个枪决后，走上前来，轻轻擦拭掉你脸上的污渍。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"speaker":"观星者","content":"小怪物啊……你既是执行者，也是守护者。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"speaker":"观星者","content":"既是开拓者，也是回忆者。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你……到底是什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"content":"我不知道。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"content":"但或许，这就是我接受这个任命，这个命运的原因。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"content":"我将以执行者，守护者，开拓者，回忆者的诸多身份，去探明这个世界。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"speaker":"观星者","content":"就算这个世界，是虚假的？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"content":"就算这个世界是虚假的。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"content":"你说我的躯壳是虚假的，看不到我的灵魂，眼睛下尽是无尽深渊。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"content":"那我是否可以认为，我现在所受的这些苦难，所遇到的谎言，在被这具空洞黑暗的身体……吞噬，淹没，打磨之后。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"content":"最终，诞生出属于我的灵魂。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"speaker":"观星者","content":"诞生灵魂？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"content":"观星者的脸上露出一丝扭曲的表情，像是看着什么不可思议的事物。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"你耸耸肩，巡视了一下四周，看到你那件比你更早掉下去的，早已被抓得破烂和浸满血污的外套。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"content":"你走过去，掀开内衬，从里面拿出了什么——那是观星者最后一张，代表死亡的星牌，可是你却在星牌的背后，发现了另一张……","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"options":["预言游戏，结束了。"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304068,"trial_step":68,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"预言游戏，结束了。","goto":69}]},{"step":68,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你还是想说你赢了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"speaker":"观星者","content":"就算你现在用枷锁束缚住我，本质上也无法打破我的预言。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你还是会……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"content":"我赢了。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"options":["安纳奇亚"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304073,"trial_step":73,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"安纳奇亚","goto":74}]},{"step":73,"content":"是我赢了，安纳奇亚，你的预言被我打破了。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"content":"你轻轻地念出这个名字，看着观星者错愕的表情，露出了微笑。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"content":"你向她展示着你刚才拿出的东西——那是一张和衣服一起被血染红的星牌。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"content":"那张在废墟上，观星者用来彰显你接下来命运的星牌。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"可你翻到这张星牌的背面——那张拿着镰刀，站在橡木桶上哀嚎的死神，变成了一颗闪耀的新星，在卡牌中央炸开。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"……它居然在这里。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"真是不可思议……我的小怪物……你这是改变了星牌吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"content":"我确实有“改变”的力量，但不是改变星牌。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"content":"你指了指星牌上，印着安纳奇亚名字的上方，漂亮的花体字组成一个小小的，充满力量的词语：希望。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"content":"我拥有的是改变命运的能力。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"content":"至少我希望我可以改变自己的命运。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"content":"名为安纳奇亚的观星者接过你手里的星牌，端详半晌，随即大笑不止。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"哈哈哈哈哈！！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"好一个打破预言游戏，好一个改变命运的能力！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"好奇，我太好奇了……！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"我的小怪物，你总能让我如此惊喜！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"content":"安纳奇亚来到你的面前，与你对视，捧起你的双手按在她的怀里。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"你赢了，小怪物，这场游戏的胜利是属于你的。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304092,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"我看破了世界，找寻到了真实之境，你看破了我的真名，执意要改变自己的命运。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"你我……是一样的，我们是同类！小怪物！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"content":"你的掌心，感受到安纳奇亚的心跳，很快，很快。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"我决定留在你的身边了，小怪物……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"像今天这样继续使用我吧，我的局长大人。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304097,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"content":"你……妥协了？","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304098,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"不不不……我没有。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304099,"trial_step":99},{"step":99,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"只是我太好奇了！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304100,"trial_step":100},{"step":100,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"当一具虚假的躯壳，诞生出真实的灵魂，那么这个人最后的命运将会是什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304101,"trial_step":101},{"step":101,"content":"我一直不明白，为什么你要认为我的存在是虚假？","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304102,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"……你就当，只要是诞生在这个世界上的人，都是虚假的吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304103,"trial_step":103},{"step":103,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"人类的骨肉，鲜血，皮囊，思想，都是一层层伪装自己的面纱，这让他们看上去像是存在的真实。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304104,"trial_step":104},{"step":104,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"我能看穿他们，小怪物，这些对我来说不过镜花水月——不然为何这些人的内心，总能被我轻易操控，暴露无遗？","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304105,"trial_step":105},{"step":105,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"但你……你是不一样的……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304106,"trial_step":106},{"step":106,"content":"风吹了过来，安纳奇亚的衣摆也随之飘扬，就像你第一次见她在月下的砂海中起舞一般。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304107,"trial_step":107},{"step":107,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"你承认自己的虚假，却努力寻找着真实……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304108,"trial_step":108},{"step":108,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"你拖着虚假的躯壳，追寻真实的灵魂……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304109,"trial_step":109},{"step":109,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"谢谢幻花带我找到你……哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304110,"trial_step":110},{"step":110,"speaker":"安纳奇亚","content":"就让我跟随着你吧，我一定要看到……你找寻到这个世界的真实的那一刻。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304111,"trial_step":111}]}